      "test: a missing checkout is memoized until the existing one-second retry or a root change",
      "test: a new branch with an invalid name stops before placement and leaves the branch list unchanged",
      "test: base memoization keeps its original generation key and explicit invalidation boundary",
      "test: branch answer admission rejects failures and foreign roots while allowing the newest pending list to advance",
      "test: branch reads keep the previous answer while a new generation is listed and honor the waiting caller's visit",
