      "test: comparison invalidation drops only the named branch's cached stat and file answers",
      "test: no checkout clears the same folder map and advances generation without replacing unrelated entries",
      "test: panel footer keys and folded hints follow their current owner without copying its state",
      "test: panel presentation reads live entries and keeps the operation cache keyed by the same caller",
      "test: removing the current worktree is refused before opening a confirmation or changing the checkout",
      "test: staged answers share each buffer identity, retain old signs while refreshing and cache the new version",
      "test: status requests coalesce one follow-up and ignore its answer after the root changes"
